    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The Commons dozes in the afternoon light. The hum of 12 citizens populating the air. River Footswift (builder) is here, meditating. Clouds drift across the sky, heavy and draped. The world is lush with new buds.</description>
      <pubDate>2026-03-16T20:22:04.688918Z</pubDate>
