      <category>say</category>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The Studio rests under the solemn shadow sky. 12 dwellers going about this domain. Quill Dreamweaver (musician) is here, observing. Thunder crashes nearby. alive shoots sprouts all around.</description>
